ate":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-11T09:08:52-07:00","id":1127675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wormwood</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/863020-inspirational-images-for-beast?p=1127669#post1127669\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dunno, Aang feels more like a mage. I could imagine Zuko as a Dragon-Horror-ed Beast with Dragonbreath, either Eshmaki or Namtaru.<br /> Toph as a Tyrant, Anakim seems fine, with a Badgermole as a Horror and some homebrew atavisms Regarding traveling through earth, sure.<br /> Katara as a Makara, okay (really liked that Wan She Tong Horror Image earlier).<br /> But somehow, Aang just does not speak Beast to me.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I put Zuko as a Namtaru, because pretty much everything about his character development fits it perfectly. In addition to having a prominent facial scar, he's looked down upon and ostracized by his own country and both his father and sister have tried to murder him at least once. It also took a while before any of the heroes accepted him into their group, and even longer before they were willing to trust him.<br /> <br /> As for Aang being a Beast, I could see him as a Nemesis. The Fire Nation directed large portions of their military assets specifically to hunt down and kill him, because they knew he was a threat to their global conquest. And most people throughout the series treated the Avatar with either reverent faith, or abject fear. Once he was forced into the Avatar state (i.e Incarnate form), most people decided to run in the opposite direction, except for Azula, who was psychotic enough to shoot a demigod in the back.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://images.8tracks.com/cover/i/002/486/132/AZULA-avatar-the-last-airbender-33480704-1010-1024__1_-3655.jpg?rect=0,7,1010,1010&amp;q=98&amp;fm=jpg&amp;fit=max\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""}