adius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/18251015-0196-4a02-acde-36f9c65097fd/daa45dl-db5d513d-f0c2-428a-b4b9-e1c436e61504.png/v1/fill/w_1024,h_768,q_80,strp/smokiiiing_by_tapwing_daa45dl-fullview.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..vf5yO7hChd2hL7HWK0CsK2oRPQKtjAFlZZCWa6dXFJ0\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EsoSiIa.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/564x/45/3f/3d/453f3d36cf25c2d4e310f748aa9efdad.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/564x/14/b6/54/14b654ec7029a98b718bf399b0b98c13.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><ol class=\"decimal\"><li>A Beast fused with their dragon-like Horror in their lair having a quick smoke. Definitely belongs to the Anakim or the Eshmaki in terms of family.</li> <li>Not... entirely sure what to make of this. A Hero, mayhaps, closing in to finish off the Beast they've been hunting?</li> <li>A BoarMan/<a href=\"https://minecraft.gamepedia.com/Piglin\" target=\"_blank\">Piglin</a> Style Horror. Is most likely of the Anakim Family. Probable Hungers are Tyrant (none can resist the Hunter's Might), Collector (Gathers body parts), Predator (seeks out humans to feed its cannibalistic hunger), Nemesis (looks to punish those who practice cannibalism without proper cause) or Enabler (tempts people to indulge in murderous Wrath and/or cannibalistic Gluttony). Also just Inspired my first ever Beast character. And I do mean <b><i><u>EVER</u></i></b>.</li> <li>A dragon-like horror roaming through it's forest-style lair.</li> </ol><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/863020-inspirational-images-for-beast?p=1375081#post1375081\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Either an eshmaki or inguma horror with a Hunger for Prey. Damn I love the new fiddlesticks</div> </div> </div> </div>Eeeyup. And you just gave me Inspiration for my second ever Beast Character!<br /> <br /> Edit; Actually, the fourth image has just inspired a <i>third</i> Beast Character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 03-17-2020, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-17T12:21:30-07:00","id":1375310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class